{"i":68,"text":"Data Privacy Act of 2012 (RA 10173): data subject rights, data protection officers, NPC complaints; general information, not legal advice","where":"games/objection/data.ts#CONTENT_REVIEW"},
{"i":69,"text":"Right to be informed","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":70,"text":"You have the right to know what personal data is collected, why, who gets it and how long it is kept, before it is used.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":71,"text":"Right to access","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":72,"text":"You can ask to see the personal data an organisation keeps about you, and where it came from.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":73,"text":"Right to object","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":74,"text":"You can say no to some uses of your data, such as marketing, and to certain automated decisions about you.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":75,"text":"Right to correct","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":76,"text":"If your data is wrong or out of date, you can ask the organisation to fix it.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":77,"text":"Right to erase or block","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":78,"text":"Right to data portability","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":79,"text":"You can ask for a copy of your data in a common format, so you can take it to another service.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":80,"text":"Right to damages","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":81,"text":"If misuse of your data causes you harm, you may be paid for it.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":82,"text":"Right to complain","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":83,"text":"You can complain to the organisation’s Data Protection Officer first, then to the National Privacy Commission.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":84,"text":"Ask for a human review","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":85,"text":"If a computer program made a big decision about you, you can ask for an explanation and for a person to look at it again.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":86,"text":"Who is responsible","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":87,"text":"The organisation that chooses to use AI or your data answers for what happens. “The AI did it” is not an excuse.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":88,"text":"The sent log","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":89,"text":"The {org} app’s own log: on the day in question, {who}’s {thing} was emailed to an address that is not {who}’s.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":90,"text":"The privacy notice","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":91,"text":"The notice {who} saw when signing up: “Your {thing} is seen only by you and the doctors you choose.” It does not mention outside companies.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":92,"text":"The Help page","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":93,"text":"The app’s Help page, with an email address for the Data Protection Officer at the bottom.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":94,"text":"The sign-up receipt","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":95,"text":"A receipt that {who} signed up for the {org} app and saved a {thing} there.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":96,"text":"The breach rule","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":97,"text":"The National Privacy Commission’s rule, in plain words: after a serious data breach, the organisation must tell the Commission and the people affected within 72 hours.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":98,"text":"The claim receipt","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":99,"text":"A stamped receipt: {org} received {who}’s {thing}, with all the papers, on the day it was sent.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":100,"text":"The rejection letter","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":101,"text":"The letter to {who}: “Your claim was flagged by the system. No further action.” It gives no reason.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":102,"text":"The system log","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":103,"text":"{org}’s system log: Flagged, Rejected, Letter sent. Time between flag and rejection: 0 minutes. Staff review: none.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":104,"text":"The member list","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":105,"text":"Two members with similar names. The flag came from the other member’s history, which was linked to {who} by mistake.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":106,"text":"The claims policy","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":107,"text":"{org}’s claims policy: “A member may appeal a rejected claim in writing.”","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":108,"text":"The clinic chat page","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":109,"text":"The {org} web page: a smiling nurse photo and the label “{bot}”. Nowhere does it say that this is an AI.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":110,"text":"The chat","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":111,"text":"{who}: “My child has a very high fever and is very sleepy.” {bot}: “It is probably nothing. Rest at home and wait. No need to see a health worker.”","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":112,"text":"Asking for a person","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":113,"text":"{who} typed “Can I talk to a real person?” three times. {bot} answered each time: “I am here to help! Let us keep chatting.”","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":114,"text":"The clinic’s settings","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":115,"text":"The clinic’s own settings page: “Chat history stored: 12 months. Shared with: the chatbot vendor.”","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":116,"text":"The clinic hours","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":117,"text":"{org}’s notice: “Open Monday to Saturday. Walk-ins welcome. Chat assistant available day and night.”","where":"games/objection/data.ts#EVIDENCE"},
{"i":118,"text":"The leaked {thing}","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":119,"text":"{who} saved a {thing} in the {org} health app. A stranger got hold of it. At the barangay hall, {who} asks: who is answerable?","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":120,"text":"{org} app manager","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":121,"text":"{who}’s private health information reached a stranger.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":122,"text":"Pulso Plus","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":123,"text":"SariLab","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":124,"text":"Gamot-Gamot","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":125,"text":"lab result","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":126,"text":"check-up note","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":127,"text":"vaccine record","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":128,"text":"{who} saved their {thing} in the {org} app last month.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":129,"text":"It is routine. Users keep their health papers in one place, so they can find them when they need them.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":130,"text":"The sign-up receipt shows exactly this. It is true and does not clash with any evidence.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":131,"text":"{org} makes the app and decides how it handles users’ data.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":132,"text":"We picked the storage company and we wrote the settings ourselves.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":133,"text":"That is true, and it is why {org} is the one that is accountable.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":134,"text":"The app has a Data Protection Officer, and the contact is on the Help page.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":135,"text":"Open the Help page and scroll down. There is an email address for the DPO.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":136,"text":"The Help page screenshot agrees. This statement is true.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":137,"text":"{who} wrote to our help desk, and we answered two days later.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":138,"text":"It was a standard message. It did not explain what happened.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":139,"text":"The help desk record agrees. A weak, slow reply is poor service, but the statement itself is true.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":140,"text":"Health information counts as sensitive personal information.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":141,"text":"Yes, our staff are trained on that. It needs extra care.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":142,"text":"True under the Data Privacy Act, and the witness is admitting it. There is nothing to object to.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":143,"text":"The app asks for a password and a code sent by text before it opens.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":144,"text":"It is the same for every user.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":145,"text":"True. Logging in was not what went wrong, so this is not the false statement.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":146,"text":"No one outside has ever seen {who}’s {thing}. Our system is perfectly safe.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":147,"text":"Perfectly safe, yes. We checked. Well, we checked the main screen. Not the logs.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":148,"text":"The sent log shows the {thing} went to a stranger’s address, so “no one outside has seen it” is false.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":149,"text":"Records and logs show what really happened. Ask to see them.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"},
{"i":150,"text":"We told {who}, in our privacy notice, that the {thing} could be shared with outside companies.","where":"games/objection/data.ts#TEMPLATES"}
]
